00:11:36,083 --> 00:11:39,823
Chery has a diesel-hybrid ute
due before the end of 2026,

233
00:11:39,873 --> 00:11:43,763
with a petrol-hybrid
version expected in 2027.

234
00:11:43,813 --> 00:11:50,333
JAC, GWM, BYD, KGM and Deepal are
already selling electrified utes here.

235
00:11:51,051 --> 00:11:54,281
And number one: the Nissan
Navara Pro plug-in hybrid.

236
00:11:54,331 --> 00:11:56,681
This is the one that
really caught my attention.

237
00:11:56,731 --> 00:11:58,401
In October 2026,

238
00:11:58,451 --> 00:12:02,341
Nissan confirmed a plug-in hybrid version
of the next Navara for Australia in

239
00:12:02,391 --> 00:12:03,721
2027.

240
00:12:03,771 --> 00:12:05,761
The preliminary figures are huge:

241
00:12:05,811 --> 00:12:08,201
300 kilowatts and 800 newton-metres,

242
00:12:08,251 --> 00:12:12,781
from a 2.0-litre turbo petrol engine
combined with a high-output electric

243
00:12:12,831 --> 00:12:15,321
motor and an eight-speed automatic.

244
00:12:15,371 --> 00:12:18,841
Nissan is targeting 3,500
kilograms of braked towing,

245
00:12:18,891 --> 00:12:21,821
and a payload of up to 1,000 kilograms.

246
00:12:21,871 --> 00:12:27,621
For comparison, CarExpert listed the BYD
Shark 6 Performance at a 725-kilogram

247
00:12:27,671 --> 00:12:32,301
payload, and the Ford Ranger
Hybrid Wildtrak at 901 kilograms.

248
00:12:32,351 --> 00:12:38,401
CarExpert also listed the GWM Cannon
Alpha plug-in hybrid at 685 kilograms,

249
00:12:38,451 --> 00:12:44,461
the Chery Stockman at 765 kilograms
with 3,495 kilograms of towing,

250
00:12:44,511 --> 00:12:49,181
and the JAC T9 plug-in
hybrid at 915 kilograms.

251
00:12:49,231 --> 00:12:50,201
So on paper,

252
00:12:50,251 --> 00:12:54,121
the Navara Pro plug-in hybrid could
out-carry all of its main rivals.

253
00:12:54,171 --> 00:12:55,861
There are still some big unknowns.

254
00:12:55,911 --> 00:12:57,441
Nissan hasn't announced the price,

255
00:12:57,491 --> 00:12:59,941
the battery size or the
electric-only range.

256
00:12:59,991 --> 00:13:01,561
Those will come closer to launch.

257
00:13:01,611 --> 00:13:03,161
But here's why it's number one.

258
00:13:03,211 --> 00:13:05,441
Utes are the most important
segment in Australia,

259
00:13:05,491 --> 00:13:07,881
and they're the furthest
behind on emissions.

260
00:13:07,931 --> 00:13:11,761
The Ford Ranger and the Toyota HiLux
are still mostly sold as diesels.

261
00:13:11,811 --> 00:13:15,041
A plug-in hybrid ute with
more power than a Raptor,

262
00:13:15,091 --> 00:13:18,721
full towing capacity and a one-tonne
payload is exactly the kind of vehicle

263
00:13:18,771 --> 00:13:23,021
that could convince tradies and farmers
that electrified utes can do the job.

264
00:13:23,071 --> 00:13:25,681
And Nissan says Australia
helped design it.

265
00:13:25,731 --> 00:13:27,661
Nissan Oceania's managing director,

266
00:13:27,711 --> 00:13:32,401
Steve Milette, said: "Australia wasn't
simply where we tested Navara Pro PHEV.

267
00:13:32,451 --> 00:13:34,491
It was one of the markets
helping shape it."

268
00:13:35,171 --> 00:13:36,721
Before we get to what it all means,

269
00:13:36,771 --> 00:13:39,721
a few honourable mentions
that just missed the list.

270
00:13:39,771 --> 00:13:44,661
The new Nissan Patrol is switching from
its big V8 to a 3.5-litre twin-turbo

271
00:13:44,711 --> 00:13:49,681
V6 with 317 kilowatts
and 700 newton-metres.

272
00:13:49,731 --> 00:13:52,861
CarsGuide reported orders
opening in late 2026,

273
00:13:52,911 --> 00:13:58,261
with cars arriving in late 2026 or early
2027 and Nissan says Australia will

274
00:13:58,311 --> 00:14:00,301
be the first right-hand-drive
market for it.

275
00:14:00,351 --> 00:14:06,481
The Zeekr 8X is a plug-in hybrid SUV
with a claimed 660 kilowatts combined.

276
00:14:06,531 --> 00:14:09,421
CarsGuide estimated it at
around eighty thousand dollars.

277
00:14:09,471 --> 00:14:14,321
The Polestar 5 is a big electric
sedan with up to 650 kilowatts,

278
00:14:14,371 --> 00:14:17,361
priced from $171,100.

279
00:14:17,411 --> 00:14:18,981
And at the other end of the market,

280
00:14:19,031 --> 00:14:24,701
the Renault Symbioz is a
compact hybrid SUV from $36,990.

281
00:14:24,751 --> 00:14:26,121
And one that won't be coming:

282
00:14:26,171 --> 00:14:29,941
Isuzu has cancelled its plans for
the electric D-Max in Australia.

283
00:14:29,991 --> 00:14:32,061
As Isuzu's Rod Caldwell put it:

284
00:14:32,111 --> 00:14:35,601
"Customers don't want it." Not every
brand thinks the electric ute's time has

285
00:14:35,651 --> 00:14:36,041
come.

286
00:14:36,091 --> 00:14:37,821
So what does all this mean for you?

287
00:14:37,871 --> 00:14:42,141
If you're buying a ute: 2027 will
give you more choice than ever before.

288
00:14:42,191 --> 00:14:44,841
The Navara Pro plug-in
hybrid, the GAC ute,

289
00:14:44,891 --> 00:14:48,401
Chery's hybrid utes and eventually the
Hyundai ute will all be fighting the

290
00:14:48,451 --> 00:14:51,681
Ranger, the HiLux and the BYD Shark 6.

291
00:14:51,731 --> 00:14:56,081
That kind of competition usually means
sharper prices and better equipment.

292
00:14:56,131 --> 00:14:59,581
And as we covered in our
video on 2027 ute prices,

293
00:14:59,631 --> 00:15:02,741
the emissions rules are pushing
every brand in the same direction.

294
00:15:02,791 --> 00:15:07,021
If you're buying an SUV: the plug-in
hybrid fight is about to get serious.

295
00:15:07,071 --> 00:15:10,341
A cheaper RAV4 plug-in
hybrid, the Omoda 7,

296
00:15:10,391 --> 00:15:13,906
and dozens of Chinese plug-in hybrids
mean more choice under sixty thousand

297
00:15:13,956 --> 00:15:15,621
dollars than ever before.

298
00:15:15,671 --> 00:15:17,881
If you're buying an electric
car: watch the timing.

299
00:15:17,931 --> 00:15:20,161
As we covered in our last video,

300
00:15:20,211 --> 00:15:25,141
the fringe benefits tax exemption for
EVs over $75,000 changes on the 1st of

301
00:15:25,191 --> 00:15:30,381
April 2027, and a new luxury car tax
threshold for zero-emissions vehicles is

302
00:15:30,431 --> 00:15:32,641
due from July 2027.

303
00:15:32,691 --> 00:15:34,501
And whichever new model catches your eye,

304
00:15:34,551 --> 00:15:37,981
do your homework on the brand behind it
especially if it's a brand that's new

305
00:15:38,031 --> 00:15:39,081
to Australia.

306
00:15:39,131 --> 00:15:41,101
As we covered in our BYD videos,

307
00:15:41,151 --> 00:15:44,841
a great car can still be a frustrating
ownership experience if parts take

308
00:15:44,891 --> 00:15:47,831
months and the nearest approved
repairer is hours away.

309
00:15:47,881 --> 00:15:50,161
Before you buy, ask three questions.

310
00:15:50,211 --> 00:15:52,201
Where is the nearest service centre?

311
00:15:52,251 --> 00:15:54,821
Are crash parts for this
model stocked in Australia?

312
00:15:54,871 --> 00:15:58,221
And how long is the warranty and who
stands behind it if the local importer

313
00:15:58,271 --> 00:15:59,201
changes?

314
00:15:59,251 --> 00:16:01,601
And for any electrified ute or SUV,

315
00:16:01,651 --> 00:16:04,921
look for real-world tests,
not just brochure numbers.

316
00:16:04,971 --> 00:16:08,921
Electric range, fuel use while towing
and real payload with a canopy and

317
00:16:08,971 --> 00:16:12,001
accessories fitted can be very different
from the figures on the website.

318
00:16:12,051 --> 00:16:15,361
And if you're in no hurry:
waiting a few months can pay off.

319
00:16:15,411 --> 00:16:18,661
New models often push down the
prices of the cars they replace.

320
00:16:18,711 --> 00:16:21,781
And brand-new models often
have early teething problems.

321
00:16:21,831 --> 00:16:24,391
There's nothing wrong with letting
someone else find them first.

322
00:16:25,261 --> 00:16:29,631
So here's the full list of new
cars coming to Australia for 2027.

323
00:16:29,681 --> 00:16:31,851
Number ten, the Honda Super-One.

324
00:16:31,901 --> 00:16:34,431
Number nine, the BMW iX3.

325
00:16:34,481 --> 00:16:37,151
Number eight, the Mazda CX-6e.

326
00:16:37,201 --> 00:16:40,331
Number seven, the BYD Atto 3 Evo.

327
00:16:40,381 --> 00:16:42,811
Number six, the Omoda 4 and 7.

328
00:16:42,861 --> 00:16:45,331
Number five, the Mitsubishi Pajero.

329
00:16:45,381 --> 00:16:48,631
Number four, the cheaper
Toyota RAV4 plug-in hybrid.

330
00:16:48,681 --> 00:16:50,551
Number three, the Hyundai ute.

331
00:16:50,601 --> 00:16:52,071
Number two, the GAC ute.

332
00:16:52,121 --> 00:16:55,331
And number one, the Nissan
Navara Pro plug-in hybrid.

333
00:16:55,381 --> 00:16:57,191
The big picture is clear.

334
00:16:57,241 --> 00:17:00,161
2027 is the year electrified
utes go mainstream,

335
00:17:00,211 --> 00:17:02,451
plug-in hybrid SUVs get cheaper,

336
00:17:02,501 --> 00:17:05,431
and the Chinese brands take the fight
straight to the biggest names in the

337
00:17:05,481 --> 00:17:06,231
country.

338
00:17:06,281 --> 00:17:08,291
The old best-sellers aren't going away.

339
00:17:08,341 --> 00:17:10,771
But they've never faced
this much competition.

340
00:17:10,821 --> 00:17:11,991
One last reminder:

341
00:17:12,041 --> 00:17:15,771
launch dates and prices can change,
especially for brand-new models.

342
00:17:15,821 --> 00:17:19,331
Some of the prices in this video are
estimates from the motoring media,

343
00:17:19,381 --> 00:17:20,171
not official figures.

344
00:17:20,221 --> 00:17:23,011
I'll keep tracking these
cars as they get closer,

345
00:17:23,061 --> 00:17:25,331
and I'll tell you when
the real prices land.

346
00:17:25,381 --> 00:17:27,691
If you enjoyed this,
hit like and subscribe,

347
00:17:27,741 --> 00:17:30,251
and share it with someone
who's planning their next car.

348
00:17:30,301 --> 00:17:33,811
Tell me in the comments: which
of these would you buy in 2027?

349
00:17:33,861 --> 00:17:37,771
And I'll be back with more on what's
changing for Aussie drivers next year.

350
00:17:37,821 --> 00:17:38,941
See you in the next one.
